---
// GHLForm component - Now integrated into beautiful modals
// This component is deprecated in favor of LeadModal for better UX
---
<div class="text-center p-8 bg-surface/50 rounded-xl border border-border">
  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-primary">Ready to Get Started?</h3>
  <p class="text-white/70 mb-6">Click below to open our streamlined contact form</p>
  <button
    type="button"
    class="btn-primary"
    onclick="openLeadModal('contact-form')"
  >
    Get Started Now
  </button>
</div> 